Z||000018||batboy||07-12-2000||12:03 AM||||The 3.4 is a Chevy 60 degree V6, same as the 3.1 and 2.8 engines. It'll bolt right up. You do have to relocate the starter and maybe a couple other mods.<P> <A HREF="http://members.yourlink.net/dragon/parks/e-conv.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://members.yourlink.net/dragon/parks/e-conv.htm</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000019||Phil||07-12-2000||07:12 AM||||The N* was not in a Fiero and the numbers were corrected (Dynojet) I was 222HP and 273Ft-lbs. He was 236 and 255 torque||||reg||1
